(Bug #73: the corruption was never a consequence of the CALL being inside
 the loop. Here the loop is closed by an ordinary statement's period and
 the call stands at the true top level - and before the fix it still read
 its tag from an uninitialised register.)

For each attempt from 1 to 2,
    If attempt is 99 then, Break.
To examine with a value called given.
    Print "{given's type}".

Print "the loop is closed by this period".

examine of "hello".
Exit 0.
